{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgENnyudi2uRaJkgmjLQA", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1797 年。** 这是多数来源给出的整段城墙最终完工的年份。\n\n- 陆地一侧的城墙在 1698 年前后完成。\n- 海湾一侧的城墙和女墙到 1740 年完成。\n- 1797 年加上了壕沟和掩蔽通道,整个工程到此结束。\n\n各来源的说法并不一致。有的把起点定在 1663 年或 1671 年,把 1740 年当作终点。我按 1674 年开工、1797 年全部完工的说法作答。我只做了一次搜索,没有打开原始 PDF 核对。\n\nSources:\n- [Murallas de La Habana – EcuRed](https://www.ecured.cu/Murallas_de_La_Habana)\n- [Muralla de La Habana – Cubadecentel](https://cubadecentel.com/havanaENG/muralla_de_la_habana/muralla_de_la_habanaENG1.htm)\n- [Colecciones Digitales OHC](https://coleccionesdigitales.ohc.cu/files/original/91f5adf80ac7c4c11e5786727b0cedb1b6f5db33.pdf)\n- [Fortificaciones españolas en Cuba – EcuRed](https://www.ecured.cu/Fortificaciones_espa%C3%B1olas_en_Cuba)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1219, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4330, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1219}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:43:28.894Z", "request_id": "req_011CgENnyd2GT2qB3zfGzHvH"}
